# Expand municipality / hodonym / microtoponym seeds from Wikidata (CC0).
# Run at https://query.wikidata.org/ — do not dump the result into git.
# Insert only matchable Q-ids as wd:{id}; never gn:{id}; never hflabs tables.

# Urban okrugs (Q13626398) of already curated cities via P131.
